{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the plane crash was only the beginning \u2014 now you must find a way to escape the island and survive the strange creatures that inhabit it. Manage your ammo, survive, and explore in this terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll play through one of the mid-game levels, set in a section of the forest where you must find a way to open a gate to escape this part of the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/extras/d47b1b64a345d7dd94de6a5d7531cdd3.avif?t=1760555863\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter various puzzles that you\u2019ll need to solve in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also face the terrifying creatures of the forest, so stay alert and keep an eye on your ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/extras/99354e7ad1318f9a231b3f8feeeb8a06.avif?t=1760555863\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll have to explore to gather resources. There are several crates scattered throughout the environment \u2014 destroy them to collect useful items, so exploring carefully will be highly beneficial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Types of Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can try out different types of weapons such as a pistol, a knife, a crossbow, and an assault rifle. Some weapons are available for purchase using in-game coins found throughout the level, which you can spend at a weapon vending machine located in this area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/extras/63f995b93e5d761a1ec7d348ea67ebef.avif?t=1760555863\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068760?t=1760555863","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068760?t=1760555863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/fbd22b835e83eef380bcfb73b0ea695a66c81316/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760555863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/fbd22b835e83eef380bcfb73b0ea695a66c81316/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760555863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the plane crash was only the beginning \u2014 now you must find a way to escape the island and survive the strange creatures that inhabit it. Manage your ammo, survive, and explore in this terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll play through one of the mid-game levels, set in a section of the forest where you must find a way to open a gate to escape this part of the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/extras/d47b1b64a345d7dd94de6a5d7531cdd3.avif?t=1760555863\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter various puzzles that you\u2019ll need to solve in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also face the terrifying creatures of the forest, so stay alert and keep an eye on your ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/extras/99354e7ad1318f9a231b3f8feeeb8a06.avif?t=1760555863\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll have to explore to gather resources. There are several crates scattered throughout the environment \u2014 destroy them to collect useful items, so exploring carefully will be highly beneficial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Types of Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can try out different types of weapons such as a pistol, a knife, a crossbow, and an assault rifle. Some weapons are available for purchase using in-game coins found throughout the level, which you can spend at a weapon vending machine located in this area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/extras/63f995b93e5d761a1ec7d348ea67ebef.avif?t=1760555863\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Cat Dreams Ar"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2919870","name":"Lost Dreams"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068760/7c11ef427bfe4571c4908cd464c59b090d006ce5/header.jpg?t=1760555863","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4068760/1070752441/165668581129235f681560bcba5e38d036acbcd4/1759762962/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760552303","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4068760/1070752441/165668581129235f681560bcba5e38d036acbcd4/1759762962/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760552303","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4068760/1070752441/165668581129235f681560bcba5e38d036acbcd4/1759762962/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760552303","id":257213041,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.